01:38.020 --> 01:42.740
-Spain- Barcelona

01:43.980 --> 01:48.740
Practice field of FC Cataluña

01:59.810 --> 02:02.130
I'm finally going to start camp today.

02:08.740 --> 02:13.020
For the upcoming league games which are starting soon, we'll train as a team.

02:17.260 --> 02:18.750
You're here quite early.

02:19.660 --> 02:23.070
Practice starts at 10:00, and that's just two hours from now.

02:24.220 --> 02:25.060
Rivaul-san!

02:30.960 --> 02:33.940
I couldn't wait anymore, so I arrived early.

02:33.940 --> 02:35.370
Me, too.

02:40.900 --> 02:44.390
What an incredible jump and grip!

02:45.000 --> 02:46.820
He really is the Falcon of Cataluña!

02:50.860 --> 02:53.940
U-Um... I transferred from Brazil...

02:53.940 --> 02:56.190
You're Tsubasa Ohzora, right?

02:56.190 --> 02:57.940
Have you stretched?

02:57.940 --> 02:59.600
Y-Yes.

03:01.340 --> 03:03.530
Let's go play for a bit, then.

03:04.910 --> 03:06.540
Yes! Please!

03:10.240 --> 03:11.700
His back...

03:12.360 --> 03:16.780
His back looks like an unbelievably thick wall.

03:17.530 --> 03:19.300
A tall, massive wall!

03:19.970 --> 03:28.180
But if I want to become the best player in the world, I will have to overcome that wall! {TLC:  I think "overcome" fits this sentence better?  Do you?}

03:30.420 --> 03:35.580
<b>The Falcon of Cataluña</b>

03:30.420 --> 03:35.580
<b>The Falcon of Cataluña</b>

03:38.660 --> 03:40.580
Practice starts at 10:00.

03:40.580 --> 03:43.590
Until then, you're not permitted to enter.

03:45.110 --> 03:47.870
There's still thirty minutes to wait...

03:47.870 --> 03:53.270
Hey, did you know? I heard that the Italians offered three billion for Ohzora.

03:53.270 --> 03:54.230
Seriously?

03:54.230 --> 03:55.940
Three billion, eh?

03:55.940 --> 03:58.210
I would've gone to Italy without hesitating!

03:58.210 --> 03:59.430
Of course.

03:59.430 --> 04:03.090
But then, why did Ohzora choose FC Cataluña?

04:03.090 --> 04:07.630
Rivaul, one of the best players in the world, plays here.

04:07.630 --> 04:10.340
It's going to be very hard to get a spot on that team.

04:10.950 --> 04:17.660
Ohzora might be thinking this club has things more interesting than money.

04:30.930 --> 04:33.180
Yo, it's been a while.

04:34.460 --> 04:36.190
How did your training go?

04:36.190 --> 04:37.150
Impeccable!

04:37.150 --> 04:40.330
But what a crowd at the door!

04:40.330 --> 04:42.220
And only Japanese journalists.

04:42.220 --> 04:45.620
They're here for the new face, Tsubasa Ohzora.

04:45.620 --> 04:48.240
He's the first Japanese player to play for Cataluña, right?

04:48.240 --> 04:52.220
That would be great news for a third-world soccer country like Japan.

04:54.130 --> 05:00.300
I don't know Tsubasa Ohzora's level, but it'll be impossible for him to become a starting player.

05:00.300 --> 05:04.300
Yeah, that's because we've got Rivaul on our team.

05:04.300 --> 05:09.070
But then, why did the coach want Tsubasa here?

05:09.980 --> 05:11.060
Incredible!

05:11.060 --> 05:13.580
His ball trapping and inside kick are both exceptional!

05:14.770 --> 05:19.220
I can't explain why, but my body clearly feels

05:19.220 --> 05:22.860
that Rivaul-san is an incredible player.

05:26.890 --> 05:29.740
Rivaul-san, are you okay playing one-on-one?

05:42.140 --> 05:44.740
The coach is thinking about a turnover system.

05:44.740 --> 05:46.640
Turnover system?

05:46.640 --> 05:51.820
In other words, the coach wants a team for the league games and one for the championship?

05:51.820 --> 05:55.150
Yeah, and even if Rivaul is superhuman,

05:55.150 --> 05:59.310
he can't play in all games at 100%.

05:59.310 --> 06:03.620
That's why Tsubasa is going to replace him while he's resting.

06:03.620 --> 06:06.060
I see, he's a substitute for Rivaul.

06:06.060 --> 06:08.580
Tsubasa isn't that kind of player.

06:10.490 --> 06:15.290
I was thinking that Tsubasa was here only to replace Rivaul, too.

06:15.290 --> 06:17.060
But you'll be sorry if you take him lightly.

06:17.830 --> 06:20.540
Gonzales, do you know Tsubasa?

06:21.380 --> 06:22.490
A tad.

06:22.490 --> 06:26.040
Tsubasa is the type who gets stronger as the competition gets fiercer,

06:26.040 --> 06:28.540
and he has fun while at it.

06:45.860 --> 06:48.820
And also, Tsubasa's position hasn't been decided yet.

06:48.820 --> 06:52.400
Will he be a forward or a wing?

06:52.400 --> 06:54.820
There's also a possibility he can be a defensive midfielder.

06:54.820 --> 06:57.900
Then, we're in danger of getting substituted, too?

06:57.900 --> 06:59.060
Yeah.

06:59.690 --> 07:03.540
Either way, Coach Edward is the one who's deciding all that. {koku: Not sure if the name should be "Eduardo" or some Dutch version of Edward.}

07:12.880 --> 07:14.780
The practice will start shortly.

07:14.780 --> 07:18.190
Please enter, journalists.

07:20.390 --> 07:22.020
Hurry, hurry!

07:23.930 --> 07:26.500
All right! Let's put our heart and soul into this!

07:56.780 --> 07:57.790
Tsubasa!

07:58.300 --> 08:00.550
Someone get a stretcher!

08:00.550 --> 08:01.380
Yes!

08:01.380 --> 08:02.520
Tsubasa!

08:02.520 --> 08:03.860
What could have happened?!

08:03.860 --> 08:04.900
Camera! Get the camera!

08:13.060 --> 08:17.740
-Italy- FC Piemonte Club House

08:29.140 --> 08:33.420
This is the prestigious training room of FC Piemonte.

08:35.820 --> 08:36.810
T-This is...

08:42.270 --> 08:43.690
You can enter.

08:44.830 --> 08:46.820
As expected from one of the best teams in the world.

08:48.120 --> 08:52.820
Each player here has his own machine.

08:52.820 --> 08:58.820
Each machine has its own inputed program based on a player's physique and strength.

08:59.770 --> 09:04.860
The data is regularly updated and managed by a computer.

09:06.860 --> 09:07.860
Hyuga.

09:08.460 --> 09:11.340
We'll be working out your personal program now.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.100
Are you Kojiro Hyuga?

09:23.100 --> 09:24.370
Yes.

09:24.370 --> 09:26.370
This is the guy who's responsible for this department.

09:26.370 --> 09:29.950
Mazzantini-san, the best physical coach there is.

09:31.300 --> 09:32.620
It's an honor to meet you.

09:33.820 --> 09:36.620
All right, let's get your data.{"It might be sudden, but let's get your data." is too laughably literal}

10:07.430 --> 10:09.190
It's just like I had anticipated.

10:09.190 --> 10:13.570
Why did our club, Piemonte, sign a contract with such a player? {TLC: Is "our club" really needed in this line?}

10:13.570 --> 10:14.860
Mazzantini-san!

10:15.220 --> 10:20.500
Kojiro Hyuga, with your body, it is impossible for you to play in the Italian league.

10:20.500 --> 10:22.900
What? Why are you saying that?

10:23.810 --> 10:25.300
Look at this.

10:26.860 --> 10:32.700
The muscles on your right side are too developed,

10:32.700 --> 10:35.420
leaving your left side much less developed.

10:35.420 --> 10:38.960
Your body's balance is really bad.

10:38.960 --> 10:41.630
I can't even believe you're a soccer player.

10:44.200 --> 10:48.220
Ms. Matsumoto, how have you been managing this player?

10:48.830 --> 10:50.420
Mazzantini-san...

10:50.420 --> 10:51.900
She's got nothing to do with it!

10:51.900 --> 10:56.460
More importantly, is there something wrong with my body?

10:57.010 --> 11:00.820
Oh yeah, very wrong. Seriously wrong, in fact.

11:00.820 --> 11:06.480
Kojiro Hyuga, your body is completely defective for a soccer player!

11:06.480 --> 11:09.250
My body's completely defective, you say?!

11:09.250 --> 11:15.340
Yes, I'm not sure how you got to this state, but it shows the level of Japanese soccer.

11:16.440 --> 11:19.020
I don't give a crap if you're a physical coach,

11:19.020 --> 11:23.060
nobody talks trash about my play without having seen it!

11:23.060 --> 11:24.590
Hyuga-kun, stop it!

11:41.460 --> 11:44.880
I don't care what you say about me,

11:44.880 --> 11:48.580
but I won't accept you insulting Japanese soccer!

11:48.580 --> 11:50.850
Let go of me!

11:50.850 --> 11:53.060
This act won't be without consequences.

11:53.060 --> 11:55.380
Stop it! I beg you, Hyuga-kun.

12:02.860 --> 12:03.580
What's happening?

12:05.750 --> 12:07.100
What's this ruckus about?

12:07.100 --> 12:09.030
C-Coach!

12:10.520 --> 12:13.580
Hyuga, Mazz, what's happening?

12:22.540 --> 12:23.910
Hyuga-kun...

12:38.210 --> 12:41.290
All right, leave the rest to me.

12:41.290 --> 12:44.500
Hyuga, come to my office for a moment.

12:45.160 --> 12:46.120
Yes.

12:56.910 --> 12:59.470
Without Ohzora, there's nothing to do here.

12:59.470 --> 13:04.530
But we got a very powerful photograph, so at least we have a story.

13:04.530 --> 13:08.110
That title will be "Tsubasa miserably quits the training on the first day

13:08.110 --> 13:11.860
after a warm welcome from Rivaul."

13:12.220 --> 13:15.120
But what happened between him and Rivaul? {TLC:  Please check this line.}

13:15.120 --> 13:16.820
What a bummer!

13:16.820 --> 13:19.620
If I had taken a photo earlier,

13:19.620 --> 13:23.340
I might have gotten a scoop and would've made big bucks.

13:25.390 --> 13:28.300
More importantly, is Ohzora all right?

13:28.300 --> 13:30.060
I hope he's not injured.

13:49.980 --> 13:51.910
I've decided, Roberto.

13:54.060 --> 13:56.180
I've decided on Cataluña.

13:56.180 --> 13:59.930
I see. Cataluña? Where Rivaul plays?

13:59.930 --> 14:00.820
Yeah.

14:00.820 --> 14:03.740
You've picked a great team, Tsubasa.

14:03.740 --> 14:09.140
You'll be able to learn a lot from Rivaul.

14:10.150 --> 14:11.260
Do your best!

14:11.260 --> 14:12.220
Yeah!

14:21.050 --> 14:22.710
You're awake?

14:22.710 --> 14:23.340
Y-Yes.

14:24.070 --> 14:26.250
You've just got a mild concussion.

14:26.250 --> 14:29.380
If you rest today, you'll be able to practice tomorrow.

14:29.380 --> 14:31.190
I see.

14:35.140 --> 14:36.860
He burned me over and over again.

14:39.760 --> 14:42.380
And I couldn't get past him even once.

14:51.550 --> 14:53.380
Mazz told me everything.

14:55.930 --> 14:58.770
Violence is forbidden no matter what the reason is.

14:58.770 --> 15:00.860
During a game, that would've earned you a red card.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.330
I'm very sorry!

15:03.950 --> 15:06.210
Oh, well. Lift your head.

15:07.660 --> 15:08.860
Here's what I've decided:

15:08.860 --> 15:13.750
the physical data is only a reference for me.

15:13.750 --> 15:18.380
A badly balanced body is not a big deal. {TLC: Which do you prefer:  "A badly balanced body" OR "A bad body balance"  ??}

15:18.910 --> 15:22.230
A striker's job is to score goals.

15:22.230 --> 15:26.740
I put strikers who can score goals into my games. That is all.

15:28.320 --> 15:29.220
Yes!

15:29.220 --> 15:34.540
I was the one who insisted on recruiting you after having seen you play.

15:35.230 --> 15:37.150
I have huge expectations for you, Hyuga.

15:37.150 --> 15:38.540
Thank you very much!

15:40.380 --> 15:44.250
I will live up to your expectations, Coach!

15:44.250 --> 15:48.340
I will be a member of the top team in Piemonte!

15:53.690 --> 15:54.980
Here's some herb tea.

15:54.980 --> 15:57.360
It'll make you feel better.

15:57.360 --> 15:58.980
Thank you.

16:01.190 --> 16:07.980
By the way, how did a player like you get a concussion playing Rivaul?

16:08.540 --> 16:14.180
Well, while fighting for the ball, Rivaul-san's elbow hit me here.

16:14.180 --> 16:17.770
I see, Rivaul's elbow hit your temple.

16:21.920 --> 16:23.500
It's good!

16:23.500 --> 16:25.380
I'm happy it is.

16:27.030 --> 16:29.370
Rivaul-san is incredible, isn't he?

16:30.220 --> 16:32.870
I want to emulate everything that makes Rivaul-san good!

16:37.230 --> 16:40.590
If you did that, you'd be the world's best player.

16:41.110 --> 16:41.820
Yeah.

16:50.740 --> 16:53.380
You're quite an interesting man.

16:56.160 --> 16:59.340
Rivaul's elbow hit reminds me of something...

16:59.980 --> 17:03.390
Rivaul is usually cool, and his play is clean.

17:03.390 --> 17:07.480
He never gets irritated and plays rough during a game.

17:07.480 --> 17:12.570
But, two years ago, he got a yellow card.

17:14.530 --> 17:20.570
It was during a late league game against Bernabeu for the league championship.

17:22.470 --> 17:24.220
Since Rivaul had been playing in both the Champions League

17:24.220 --> 17:27.080
and for the Brazilian national team

17:27.090 --> 17:29.340
he was really out of it.

17:29.340 --> 17:34.860
In contrast, Bruno, Bernabeu's captain, was at his top form.

17:34.860 --> 17:38.340
He didn't give Rivaul an inch during the first half.

17:39.440 --> 17:42.730
Bernabeu were leading the game 1-0.

17:42.730 --> 17:45.200
We couldn't break through during the second half,

17:45.200 --> 17:46.870
so defeat seemed certain.

17:49.250 --> 17:51.700
In the middle of the second half,

17:51.700 --> 17:55.220
Rivaul and Bruno were fiercely fighting to regain possession of the ball.

17:55.800 --> 17:56.820
It was then that...

17:58.990 --> 18:02.340
Rivaul's elbow hit Bruno's temporal lobe.

18:07.490 --> 18:10.400
And Rivaul-san received a yellow card?

18:10.400 --> 18:10.860
Yes.

18:27.320 --> 18:30.340
And how did the game end?

18:46.170 --> 18:49.700
2-1, thanks to one goal and an assist from Rivaul.

18:52.210 --> 18:54.690
Cataluña turned the tables!

18:58.590 --> 19:05.270
After Rivaul's blow, Bruno got treated and returned to the field.

19:05.270 --> 19:07.960
He seemed to be playing normally,

19:07.960 --> 19:12.460
but his eyes weren't as sharp.

19:12.460 --> 19:17.940
That game was our springboard to win the league that year.

19:18.690 --> 19:22.390
Nobody knows if this elbow hit was intentional or not,

19:23.690 --> 19:26.460
apart from Rivaul himself.

19:27.070 --> 19:29.980
But this blow has remained in history.

19:40.910 --> 19:42.390
Thank you for the herb tea.

19:43.630 --> 19:45.360
Where are you going?

19:45.360 --> 19:46.950
Back to the practice.

19:46.950 --> 19:49.260
H-Hey! You can't do that today.

19:50.220 --> 19:54.990
I'm okay! I don't look dazed, do I?

19:57.840 --> 20:02.500
About that, you don't plan to emulate Rivaul's elbow blows, right?

20:02.500 --> 20:08.020
Nope, only his will to win.

20:14.980 --> 20:16.970
Tsubasa Ohzora...

20:17.640 --> 20:19.490
An interesting guy has arrived.

20:23.530 --> 20:27.020
Rivaul is a man who never holds back, even at practice.

20:27.500 --> 20:32.020
You can't be focused during a game if you can't concentrate during practice.

20:32.020 --> 20:34.070
That's what he's said.

20:38.020 --> 20:41.740
And Rivaul already felt it was necessary to give him an elbow blow?

20:42.970 --> 20:44.620
Ohzora Tsubasa...

20:44.620 --> 20:49.860
He's, without a doubt, the real deal.

20:51.990 --> 20:53.100
H-Hey, it's Ohzora!

20:53.100 --> 20:53.860
Eh?!

20:55.860 --> 20:57.420
Ohzora's back!

20:57.420 --> 20:58.900
Tsubasa!

21:02.870 --> 21:04.940
Excuse me, please get out of the way!

21:13.550 --> 21:15.580
All right! Photo! Take your photo shots!

21:19.190 --> 21:20.940
Tsubasa!

21:23.460 --> 21:25.460
He's so cool!

21:28.460 --> 21:30.550
This will be tomorrow's lead photo!

21:30.550 --> 21:34.380
The caption: "Despite the hard welcome from Rivaul,

21:34.380 --> 21:37.900
Tsubasa comes fiercely back onto the field!"

21:39.900 --> 21:43.780
Sorry for being late, but I'm here to practice!

21:48.740 --> 21:50.210
It's a pleasure to meet you!

21:50.210 --> 21:54.580
I'm Ohzora Tsubasa, and I'm here with Cataluña this season.

22:04.020 --> 22:10.820
Preview

22:05.340 --> 22:09.200
The FC Cataluña training camp starts with a practice game.

22:09.200 --> 22:11.930
I am the playmaker of the team made with substitutes.

22:11.930 --> 22:15.300
And Rivaul-san's on the opposite team.

22:15.300 --> 22:18.540
I am amazed by the best feints of the world!

22:18.540 --> 22:19.970
I won't lose!

22:19.970 --> 22:23.260
Thanks to my intensive training, I will beat Rivaul-san!

22:24.090 --> 22:26.140
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.340 --> 22:34.220
Run to the Opening Match!

22:26.140 --> 22:27.300
Run to the Opening Match!

22:27.870 --> 22:29.340
Look forward to it!

22:29.340 --> 22:32.080
Let's face our future! Kick off!

